keywords:
  - deterministic virtual machine
  - bytecode
  - sparse computing
  - geometric autoencoding
  - auditable adaptive systems
abstract: >-
  Jarvis-X is an experimental deterministic bytecode virtual machine and
  sparse-computing research platform focused on explicit state contracts,
  bounded execution, verifiable provenance, geometric representations and
  carefully constrained adaptive runtime experiments.
